<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns single secondary auction.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns single secondary auction.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned one single auction whereby it had sought to drain 594 million pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    594 million    1 day   24.69 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
